   "_id": 11423,
   "ANSWER": "<p>from tkinter import *</p>\n\n<p>def show_message():<br />\n&nbsp; &nbsp; label.config(text=&quot;Hello, Tkinter!&quot;)</p>\n\n<p>window = Tk()<br />\nwindow.title(&quot;Event Demo&quot;)</p>\n\n<p>label = Label(window, text=&quot;&quot;)<br />\nlabel.pack()</p>\n\n<p>button = Button(window, text=&quot;Click Me&quot;, command=show_message)<br />\nbutton.pack()</p>\n\n<p>window.mainloop()<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>This GUI reacts to user interaction via an event (button click), demonstrating core event-driven principles of input handling and dynamic output.</p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC203P",
